  "limitations": [
    "Source archives and Git bundles contain complete pinned source, docs, license files and repository history; source alone is not the offline dependency closure. Runtime images, compiled adapter and Rust vendoring artifacts are separate.",
    "The OMP adapter is community software with its own pinned adapter-utils dependency; local build/typecheck/mock smoke and module-import validation do not substitute for onsite Paperclip/OMP/model execution acceptance.",
